# Workspace workflow (always apply)

The owner tests features themselves. Agents edit code only.

- Edit files on `main` only. Do not create feature branches or pull requests.
- Do not run automated tests, typecheck/lint as a gate, or browser/manual verification unless the owner asks.
- When the change is in place, say you are done so the owner can test.
- Local-only profiles must persist the database under the device Documents folder `ecrecord_users_local`.
